#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:252
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_ScottBattleFrontierInvite"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Well, hi, hi!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Something's come up, so I have to\n"
"disembark, but am I glad to see you!\p"
"Congratulations, LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
"There's a place I'd like to invite\n"
"someone like you.\p"
"It's the…\n"
"BATTLE FRONTIER!\p"
"What's the place like?\n"
"You'll understand when you see it!\p"
"I've spoken with the ship's CAPTAIN\n"
"about this.\p"
"The next time you take a ferry,\n"
"you should be able to sail to\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"Okay, {PLAYER}{KUN}, I'll be waiting for you\n"
"at the BATTLE FRONTIER!$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：哎呀，嗨嗨！\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"我有点事要下船了，\n"
"不过能见到你真是太好了！\p"
"恭喜你成为联盟冠军！\p"
"有个地方，我很想邀请像你这样的人去。\p"
"那就是……对战开拓区！\p"
"那是个什么样的地方？你看了就知道了！\p"
"我已经和这艘船的船长说好了。\p"
"下次你乘坐渡轮的时候，\n"
"应该就能去对战开拓区了。\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"我会在对战开拓区等你的！$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "SSTidal_Text_FastCurrentsHopeYouEnjoyVoyage"
msgid ""
"This ferry is built to plow through\n"
"fast-running currents.\p"
"We hope you enjoy your voyage with us.\n"
"Feel free to explore the ship.$"
msgstr ""
"这艘渡轮是为了能在湍急的\n"
"海流中破浪前进而建造的。\p"
"希望您享受这次航行。\n"
"请随意在船上参观。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "SSTidal_Text_HopeYouEnjoyVoyage"
msgid ""
"We hope you enjoy your voyage on\n"
"our ferry.$"
msgstr "希望您享受乘坐本渡轮的航行。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "SSTidal_Text_MadeLandInSlateport"
msgid ""
"We have made land in SLATEPORT CITY.\n"
"Thank you for sailing with us.$"
msgstr "本船已抵达凯那市。感谢您的搭乘。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "SSTidal_Text_MadeLandInLilycove"
msgid ""
"We have made land in LILYCOVE CITY.\n"
"Thank you for sailing with us.$"
msgstr "本船已抵达水静市。感谢您的搭乘。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:290
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_CanRestInCabin2"
msgid ""
"It'll be some time before we make land,\n"
"I reckon.\p"
"You can rest up in your cabin if you'd\n"
"like. Your cabin's No. 2.\p"
"The bed in there is soft and plushy.\n"
"I can attest to how comfy it is!$"
msgstr ""
"我想离靠岸还要一段时间。\p"
"如果你愿意的话，可以在你的\n"
"客舱里休息。你的客舱是2号。\p"
"那里的床又软又蓬松。\n"
"我可以保证它非常舒服！$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_WeveArrived"
msgid "We've arrived!$"
msgstr "我们到了！$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:301
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_VisitOtherCabins"
msgid ""
"Go visit other cabins.\n"
"TRAINERS bored of the boat trip will\l"
"be itching to battle.$"
msgstr ""
"去其他客舱看看吧。\n"
"坐船坐腻了的训练家们正想对战呢。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:306
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_EnjoyYourCruise"
msgid "Enjoy your cruise!$"
msgstr "祝您航行愉快！$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:309
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_HorizonSpreadsBeyondPorthole"
msgid ""
"The horizon spreads beyond\n"
"the porthole.$"
msgstr "舷窗外是一望无际的地平线。$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:313
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_BrineyWelcomeAboard"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Welcome aboard, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"They made me honorary captain of\n"
"the S.S. TIDAL!\p"
"You can call me CAPTAIN BRINEY now!\p"
"You know, I retired once before,\n"
"but when I saw this majestic ship…\p"
"Let me just say, it stirred my sleeping\n"
"soul as a sailor!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：欢迎上船，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"他们让我当了潮汐号的名誉船长！\p"
"现在你可以叫我哈奇船长了！\p"
"你知道吗，我本来已经退休了，\n"
"可是看到这艘雄伟的船……\p"
"怎么说呢，\n"
"它唤醒了我沉睡已久的水手之魂！$"

#: data/maps/SSTidalCorridor/scripts.inc:323
msgctxt "SSTidalCorridor_Text_Peeko"
msgid "PEEKO: Pihyo pihyohyo…$"
msgstr "皮可：咻哟咻哟哟……$"

